[02:02:46.030] ======================================================================
[02:02:46.030] free() does not necessarily unmap the VMA; the address stays
[02:02:46.030] valid while the object lifetime has already ended.
[02:02:46.030] A plain run often prints 100 and does NOT crash - that is why
[02:02:46.030] ASan is required to detect this class of bug deterministically.
